  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Security Risks of Extractive Activity in Fragile Contexts - CRM Secure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of this contract is to &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;to support fragile and crisis-affected regions, countries and communities to achieve resilience and sustain peace by addressing the climate and environmental risks that may contribute to driving conflict and instability. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Support will be provided to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;communities and authorities in fragile contexts to better address risks to their security related to increased demand for extractive materials in fragile contexts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
